<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor"><tei:pb n="368" ed="1949 shabbat/shacharit/torah" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n392_medium.jpg"/><tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/text"/>May he help, shield and save all who trust in him; and let us say, Amen. Let us all ascribe greatness to our God, and give honor to the Torah. Let the Kohen come forward …<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">The name is given.</tei:note>. Blessed be he who in his holiness gave the Torah to his people Israel. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p></tei:div>
